Hi

It looks to me like, among other things, you've got an interaction.  So, why not plot lines for normal, atrisk and chronic separately on the main graph?

It also looks like you have outliers for both normal and chronic.  So, rather than regression lines, why not some sort of smoothed lines (loess or spline or whatever, take your pick) for each of these?

Just some ideas

Peter

